  "description": {
   "value": "<p><strong>Cost:</strong> 500eb (Expensive)</p>\n<p><em>Speeds up police efficiency by 150%, meaning they’ll finish lunch maybe half an hour early.</em></p>\n<p>A large device that must be plugged into an adequate power source and set up on a tripod to operate. When operational and activated, it scans a 10x10m/yds (5x5 Squares) area in front of it, syncs to the local Crime Analysis Database, and projects a hologram of the most likely events occurring in the scanned area from the last 2 hours. This provides a +2 bonus, or a +4 for Enforcers/Lawmen, to Deduction and Criminology Checks made to understand or study a crime scene.</p>\n<p><strong>Foundry notes:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Toggle the gear on, then tick the bonus in the roll dialog when it applies (add the extra +2 for Lawmen by hand).</li>\n</ul>\n<p><em>From <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/13EnSAoiLDsC7zmL-Jr1RqIh_EnuVuFnExqiipDVquMk/edit\">Corgo's 77 Collection V3</a> by Corgopolis (Gear, Drugs, &amp; Frames &gt; General Gear).</em></p>"
